[b]Author Respect[/b]

This continuation exists to keep saves working on current ONI builds while the original item appears unmaintained. If Neavo, Tuna / mrcyclo, or another prior author in this lineage resumes maintenance and requests that this continuation be removed or deferred in favor of their own continuation, I will take this item down or redirect users to theirs.

[b]License and Permission Status[/b]

I found no explicit license file or source repository for Neavo's original mod. Tuna's source repository is public, but no license file was found there. This continuation uses a distinct mod static ID, preserves the original building prefab ID for save compatibility, and credits known authors and references. If an original author requests changes, credit adjustments, or removal, I will update accordingly.

[b]Known Risk[/b]

This update fixes the loader/crash compatibility issue and the reviewed door patch hygiene issues. A third-party fix comment reports carried critters can get stuck in doors; I have not reproduced or claimed that gameplay issue fixed here.
